( TWO NEWTON SOLVES. )
VARIABLE NX VARIABLE NF VARIABLE ND VARIABLE NM
: NEWTON
  3 1 DO I NM ! 1500 NX !
    8 0 DO
      NX @ DUP F* NF !
      NM @ 1 = IF NF @ 2000 - NF ! NX @ 2 * ND !
      ELSE NF @ NX @ F* NX @ - 2000 - NF !
           NX @ DUP F* 3 * 1000 - ND ! THEN
      ND @ 0= IF 1 ND ! THEN
      NX @ NF @ ND @ F/ - NX !
    LOOP
    ." NEWTON " NM @ . NX @ . NF @ . CR
  LOOP ;
NEWTON
